Specifications
--------------

No specification text is reproduced, and no specification document is
redistributed. Message and field names, enumeration values, error codes
and subprotocol names are interface facts every implementation must use;
the comments cite clause numbers in our own words. The OCPP documents
(1.6 edition 2 with OCPP-J 1.6 and OCPP-S 1.6, the 1.6 security
whitepaper, 2.0.1 edition 4 and 2.1 edition 2 with their errata) are
published by the Open Charge Alliance under CC BY-ND 4.0 and are used
for facts only.

